{c: Verse 1}
[G#m]Maanaa Ho Tum, [C#m]Behad HaNsi
[D#]Aise Bure, [G#m]Ham Bhii Nahii.N
[B]Dekho Kabhii To, [C#m]Pyaar Se
[D#]Darate Ho [G#m]Kyu Iqaraar Se
[B]Khulataa Nahi, [D#]Kuchh Dilarubaa
[E]Tum Hamase [C#m]Khush Ho, [G#m]Yaa Ho Khafaa
[B]Tirachhii Nazar, [D#]Tiikhii Adaa
[E]Lagate [C#m]Ho Kyu, [G#m]Bezaar Se
[B]Dekho Kabhii To, [C#m]Pyaar Se ...
[D#]Darate Ho Kyuu.N, [G#m]Iqaraar Se
[B]tum do kadam [D#]do saath agar,
[E]aasaan [C#m]ho [G#m]jaaye safar
[B]chhodo bhee ye [D#]duniya kaa dar
[E]todo [C#m]naa dil [G#m]inkaar se
[B]dekho kabhee [C#m]to pyaar se,
[D#]darte ho [G#m]kyo ikaraar se
